# GCP stack — Orgo replaced (ZTE-010 / ZTE-014)

Runbook: `docs/GCP_SETUP.md`

## Project + secrets

- [ ] `GCP_PROJECT_ID` in lab-mesh.env only
- [ ] Secret Manager: `shopify-admin` (no token in vault/git)
- [ ] `./scripts/gcp-preflight.sh` PASS

## Cloud Run

- [ ] `./scripts/gcp-deploy-verify.sh` or CI equivalent
- [ ] `STUDBOT_VERIFY_URL` in host env; Studbot unlock test PASS
- [ ] DNS verify.* → managed cert

## Dark Factory site

- [ ] Firebase deploy `mission-control/factory/` → factory.* 200
- [ ] No Paperclip on public LB

## GCE workers (was Orgo)

- [ ] VM `dark-factory` (or named) on tailnet
- [ ] `gcp-dark-factory-vm-bootstrap.sh` + Hermes gateway
- [ ] Paperclip external invite (private)
- [ ] Codex capacity: N Herdr panes or N VMs — count in vault

## Orgo

- [ ] **Do not** provision new Orgo desktops for Studex
- [ ] Migrate any still-running Orgo workloads to GCE before renewal